:expect-pins 3
# Fresh-process temporal case TA-06.

# A two-way transition cycle marks the live successor with the typed lineage collision.
? collide(Epoch_Current, TransitionLineage).
# => TRUE

# The replayed predecessor receives the same typed lineage collision.
? collide(Epoch_Previous, TransitionLineage).
# => TRUE

# The reverse link cannot create a fresh accepted successor.
? succeed(Epoch_Previous, Transition).
# => FALSE
